rue,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C04-B07","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"The mascot sits before the oversized calendar with his head lowered, surrounded by repeated abstract effort marks and a conspicuously empty result area; this shifts attention from the missed action to self-blaming interpretation.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C04-B08","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"The mascot stands between the open notebook on the desk and the nearby gold-glowing phone, with his body angled toward the phone; this shows the choice that reduces present burden even when it harms a longer goal.","mode":"literal","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C04-B09","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"The mascot’s hand closes around the smartphone while the notebook page stays blank beneath the desk lamp; this makes the immediate function of escape visible without presenting the choice as a moral failure.","mode":"literal","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C04-B10","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"Later, the mascot returns to the desk and stares at a calendar with one visible interruption in its otherwise abstract effort pattern; this shows how a brief pause becomes evidence in the mind for the belief that he cannot continue.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C04-B11","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"The empty result area of the oversized calendar dominates the frame while the mascot appears small beneath it, his face lowered and the phone dim beside him; this represents self-dislike growing larger than the original interruption.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C04-B12","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"The study corner is quietly reset with the notebook open, pencil aligned, exercise shoes beside the chair, and the smartphone placed farther away; this introduces environmental cues that can reduce the distance to starting.","mode":"literal","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C04-B13","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"The mascot notices the prepared notebook and begins lowering the pencil toward the page while the phone remains small and unlit in the background; this bridges from self-blame toward repeated action initiated by a visible situational cue.","mode":"literal","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null}]}
