      "9-12 seconds: The mascot turns its gaze from the empty calendar toward the gold pulse. The black shadow grows slightly, not through realism but through spreading ink, while the effort marks remain present and continuous rather than disappearing.",
      "12-15 seconds: Pull back to reveal the path, empty calendar, mascot, and shadow connected within one sparse composition. The final image holds on the contradiction: effort exists in the frame, but the visible reward has not arrived. Transition into the explanation through a slow ink dissolve, preserving the same off-white paper field and one gold accent."
