iction and outcome.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C03-B08","script_section":"S3","visual_information":"The bent line briefly releases a small gold spark at the point of mismatch while the mascot watches; this symbolizes a prediction-error signal without depicting literal neuroscience.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C03-B09","script_section":"S3","visual_information":"The gold spark disappears and the oversized smartphone-shaped shadow spreads behind the mascot; this shows attention being pulled toward an immediately responsive alternative.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C03-B10","script_section":"S3","visual_information":"The mascot turns away from the unfinished path toward the black shadow while the calendar remains blank in the background; this links an unmet expectation to a change in behavior.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":false,"reuse_image_id":"C03-B09"},{"id":"C03-B11","script_section":"S3","visual_information":"A short path of closely spaced black effort marks leads to a tiny gold glimmer before the distant opening; this introduces a nearer feedback point within a long process.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C03-B12","script_section":"S3","visual_information":"The mascot gently touches the first small gold glimmer while the large distant opening stays unresolved; this shows how intermediate signals can make ongoing effort perceptible.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":false,"reuse_image_id":"C03-B11"},{"id":"C03-B13","script_section":"S3","visual_information":"The blank calendar is placed between the mascot and the distant opening, with several small gold glimmers along the path but no completed result; this contrasts continuous feedback with an all-or-nothing payoff.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C03-B14","script_section":"S3","visual_information":"The mascot resumes placing black mar