ion":"S4","visual_information":"The mascot sits beneath a dark looping path drawn from the drawer to his hands and back again, with the gold wrapper at the loop’s center. Purpose: expose the hidden repetition behind the apparent personal failure.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C04-B08","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"The half-open drawer remains fixed while multiple charcoal footprints repeatedly approach it from the same direction. Purpose: shift attention from willpower alone to recurring situational contact.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C04-B09","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"The mascot looks at the unchanged cabinet as the surrounding room fades into pale negative space, leaving only the drawer and its handle sharply outlined. Purpose: show how an ordinary environmental cue can organize repeated behavior.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C04-B10","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"The mascot steps away from the drawer, but a black brush path still pulls visually from his shoes back toward the opening. Purpose: represent the lingering pull of a familiar situation after the choice is made.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C04-B11","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"The mascot moves the snack drawer farther inside the cabinet and places a simple empty bowl in the former approach path. Purpose: visualize reducing repeated conflict by altering the surrounding cue.","mode":"literal","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C04-B12","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"The mascot walks through the same domestic space while the drawer stays closed and the previous black footprints fade behind him. Purpose: show that less visible struggle does not necessarily mean less self-management.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C04-B13","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"The mascot pauses beside the cabinet with relaxed shoulders as a small gold accent rests on the closed drawer handle. Purpose: mark a turning point from proving endurance toward reducing unnecessary conflict.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C04-B14","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"The mascot leaves the quiet room while the half-open drawer motif transforms into a narrow doorway behind him, its dark opening now smaller and distant. Purpose: integrate the idea that changing repeated situations can make self-control feel lighter without diminishing it.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null}]}
